# Docker images are self-contained for deployment, but only the paths copied by
# Dockerfile belong in the build context. Custom/OCA add-ons and user docs are
# mounted by Compose; private dumps, filestores and repository metadata must
# never be transferred to the builder.
*

!.dockerignore
!Dockerfile
!MANIFEST.in
!odoo-bin
!requirements.txt
!setup.py

!addons/
!addons/**
!debian/
!debian/odoo.conf
!docker/
!docker/**
!odoo/
!odoo/**
!setup/
!setup/**
